WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.500
This is Violet Glass, a skin for Video.js 10.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.500
Controls float over the film like frosted glass.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Bright scenes are the hardest test for a player.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:17.500
Dark glass and a soft scrim keep every label readable.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.000
A neon timeline shows where you are at a glance.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:26.500
Motion stays gentle, and calms down when you ask.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.000
Desktop, tablet and phone each get their own layout.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:35.000
Keyboard, touch and screen readers all work.
